                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mange ke lembe pa Yehova bino i bang’a, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod dhanu, keth weng’i kum got Seir, man ieu lembe i kume, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man iwac ire kumae, Rwoth Yehova wacu kumae; Nen, an a jadhogi, E got Seir, man abirieyo cinga i kumi, man abidwoki ni uvuru man ni wang’uic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abidwoko adhura peri ni uvuru man ibibedo ma juweki; e ibing’eyo nia an a Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ibedo kud adegi ma thum ungo, man imio nyithindho mir Israel ba tego wi palamularu i nindo mi ruvwa migi, i nindo mi kier mi kajik; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno, calu abedo kwo, Rwoth Yehova wacu, abiyiki ni rimo, man rimo bilubo toki: kum idagu rimo ngo, ka kumeno rimo bilubo toki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno abidwoko got Seir ni wang’uic man ni uvuru; man abikabu kud i bang’e ng’atu m’ukadhu kud i ie man ng’atu m’udwogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abipong’o gudine ku ju ma junego pare: i ungulu gudi peri man i poga peri man dhu pi peri ceke gibipodho ma junego ku palamularu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abidwoki ni uvuru ma thum ungo, man jubibedd i adhura peri de ngo; e wubing’eyo nia an a Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum iwacu kumae, Thek ario maeni man ng’om ario maeni gibibedo para, e wabimwonye; ento Yehova ni kuca: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno, calu abedo kwo, Rwoth Yehova wacu, abitimo calku ng’ecwiny peri, man calku kumira peri m’inyutho ku i adegi peri i kumgi; man abiketho ang’eira igi kinde m’abipoko lembe i wii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ibing’eyo nia an, an a Yehova, awinjo cac peri ceke m’iyero kum gudi mir Israel, m’iwacu kumae, Judwokogi ni uvuru, jumiogi iwa ya wanyothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wutingru giwu i kuma ku dhogwu, man wumedo lembe mu i kuma: awinjo maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Yehova wacu kumae: Kinde ma anyong’a nego ng’om dho, abidwoki ni uvuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Calu anyong’a negi kum aba mi ot mir Israel, kum ebedo ni uvuru, abitimo kumeca i kumi: ibibedo ni uvuru, E got Seir, kud Edom ceke, en e kare ceke; e gibing’eyo nia an a Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
